  "attribution": "Generated with OpenAI GPT-6 Astra. Original procedural vector artwork and original locally synthesized instrumental audio for Mangoidiots Solitaire (https://venkatarangan.github.io/mangoidiots-solitaire/). Respectful creative inspiration from Mughal-period Indian miniature painting, court costume, floral inlay, scalloped arches, and charbagh gardens; not authenticated portraits, named historical figures, or a reconstruction. The newly composed instrumental music draws on broad Sufi, Indo-Persian and Islamicate cultural influences through oud-like plucks, ney/reed-like lead, and frame-drum-inspired synthesis. It is not an authentic historical or devotional performance. No Quran recitation, adhan, religious vocals, sacred text, downloaded recordings, sampled instruments, external artwork, or copied commercial cards are used."
